    "(b) Research Courses:",
    "STAR2000, 3000, 4000[a]",
    "(c) Seminar Courses:",
    "STAR2050, 3050, 4050",
    "2. Experiential Learning:",
    "At least 4 consecutive weeks of outside Hong Kong exposure[b]",
    "Total: 12"
